    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775980/extras/835946d8e344f868d723dfd731baf4f8.poster.avif?t=1753799950\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775980/extras/835946d8e344f868d723dfd731baf4f8.webm?t=1753799950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775980/extras/835946d8e344f868d723dfd731baf4f8.mp4?t=1753799950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charlotte keeps hearing noises in her room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then something pulls her under the bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There she finds god.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this house you will:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a unique and original card game. Mix &amp; Match different spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop noises by typing them before they happen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade you sense of hearing, visual ques, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God &amp; Charlotte is a small, replayable, and quirky game created by River Gandour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join The Discord:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775980/extras/835946d8e344f868d723dfd731baf4f8.poster.avif?t=1753799950\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775980/extras/835946d8e344f868d723dfd731baf4f8.webm?t=1753799950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775980/extras/835946d8e344f868d723dfd731baf4f8.mp4?t=1753799950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charlotte keeps hearing noises in her room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then something pulls her under the bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There she finds god.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this house you will:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a unique and original card game. Mix &amp; Match different spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop noises by typing them before they happen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade you sense of hearing, visual ques, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God &amp; Charlotte is a small, replayable, and quirky game created by River Gandour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join The Discord:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
